Cheyenne, WY 82001
Re: Letter in Support of Liquor License Transfer Application
Mayor and Council Members:
This Letter is in support of 307 Racing Management, Inc.'s Liquor License Transfer
Application with the City of Cheyenne being transferred to it byKEG, Inc.dba DT's Liquor Mart
&Tusker Bar, for the licensed location at 3310 Ridge Road, Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001and is
designed to provide supplemental information to the application.We would like to request that
this transfer be effective August 1, 2024. If this location is not approved by the Wyoming Gaming
Commission on July11,2024, we reserve the right to withdraw the application.
On May16,2024, the Cheyenne Board of Adjustment approved our conditional use permit
to allow Entertainment, Amusement, and Recreation at thefacility located at 3310 Ridge Road,
Cheyenne, WY 82001.A copy of the approval letter is attached hereto as Exhibit A.After we
receive approval from the Gaming Commission, we will work with the Development/Zoning
Department tomeet the City Sign Ordinance requirements.
307 Racing Management's Afiliated entity, Wyoming Financial Properties, Inc. is under
contract to acquire the real estate in question.A copy of the proposed lease is provided with the
Application asrequired.
Section 14 of the Application requires a disclosure of certain information which is
discussed further below:
The corporate officers of 307 Racing Management are as follows:
Kyle Ridgeway, President:
D.O.B.May 20,1987
Corporate Address: 851 Werner Ct., Suite 121, Casper, WY 82601
Phone:307-235-8837
