City Council Members,
This letter is to further outline some details on 307 Racing Management's application to
transfer the liquor license from DT's Liquor Mart &Tusker Bar.On our application, we have
checked the Retail Liquor License for on&off premise bar and package store as that is how the
license is currently held.The reasoning behind this isbecause once we close the real estate deal
on the property, we will still need to operate the liquor store to get rid of the current inventory.
However, once we close the site down and begin construction to turn the space in the new
Derby Club our end goal is to only offer alcohol for on site consumption.Asyouwill see, our
lease states as such.The off-premise consumption will only be temporary.If we are granted this
license transfer, upon renewal we will mark Retail-on-premise consumption only.
